    "summary": "Fixed the bug in compute_total(). The issue was two problems: (1) the loop variable was `items[i]` but inside the loop it referenced an undefined variable `item`, and (2) it was trying to multiply a dict by an int. The fix was to change `items[i] * item[i][\"price\"]` to `items[i][\"price\"]` which directly extracts the price from each item dictionary. The output is now 7 (3+4), confirming the fix works."
